<span class="u" data-d="1" data-l="s303S"><span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s303w2">Someone</span> may respond <span class="u" data-d="3" data-l="s303w1">to this argument</span> with the following <span class="u" data-d="3" data-l="s303w3">claim</span>: The two cases are <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s303w4">not</span> the <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s303w5">same</span>. When <span class="u" data-d="3" data-l="s303w8">all this</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s303w9">happens</span> <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s303w7">to</span> the <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s303w6">craving spirit</span>, it&#x27;s <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s303w12">nothing more than</span> <span class="u" data-d="3" data-l="s303w10">his own</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s303w11">imagination</span>. <span class="u" data-d="3" data-l="s303w13">Well then</span>, what happens <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s303w15">to</span> the <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s303w14">human</span> ca<span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s303w18">n&#x27;t</span> be <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s303w17">happening</span> to him <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s303w16">either</span>, <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s303w22">because</span> it&#x27;s <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s303w21">nothing more than</span> <span class="u" data-d="3" data-l="s303w19">his</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s303w20">imagination</span>.</span>
