<div class="note"><b>AI NOTE</b> &mdash; PROVISIONAL machine alignment proposed independently by Codex, English-first. Original source wording is preserved. The second event is marked once at "happening" in the negative predicate; the preceding "what happens" is its contextual restatement. Repeated experiencers are rendered by possessive anaphora. Mind/instrument content in blos remains unwrapped within the imagination construction.</div>
